WEBVTT

00:44.669 --> 00:46.838
Miss Ayase, the sky...

00:47.338 --> 00:49.299
Is this the alien's...

00:49.382 --> 00:50.800
For real?

00:50.884 --> 00:55.096
An alien! It's a space kaiju!

00:55.180 --> 00:56.848
How do we beat that thing?

00:56.931 --> 00:58.558
No idea!

00:58.641 --> 00:59.476
Any weaknesses?

00:59.559 --> 01:02.562
No clue!

01:09.694 --> 01:11.279
An alien?

01:11.362 --> 01:13.073
Aira!

01:14.240 --> 01:15.867
Thank goodness.

01:15.950 --> 01:19.537
Everyone suddenly disappeared!

01:19.621 --> 01:21.539
Did I do something again?

01:21.623 --> 01:23.249
It's not your fault.

01:23.333 --> 01:26.294
Looks like it's best
if we group up with Momo Ayase!

01:26.377 --> 01:27.921
The sky is pitch black!

01:32.717 --> 01:34.928
It's a kaiju!

01:35.011 --> 01:37.180
Run for it!

01:54.364 --> 01:57.575
Ridiculous!

01:59.202 --> 02:01.913
- Perv!
- Help me!

02:01.996 --> 02:06.376
I can't keep running forever!

02:15.760 --> 02:18.680
Can you not do that
while we're in school uniforms?

02:18.763 --> 02:20.473
Seriously, that!

03:53.608 --> 03:55.735
Jiji! Take that guy and run!

03:55.818 --> 03:58.446
Hold on! I'm the leader!

03:58.988 --> 04:01.991
Enjoji, take that guy and flee!

04:02.617 --> 04:03.785
Got it!

04:04.827 --> 04:08.706
Regroup at my place later!

04:16.256 --> 04:18.800
You barfnugget! You can eat it!

04:20.843 --> 04:22.512
What power!

04:24.222 --> 04:27.183
Before it gigantifies,
it's an invisible speed type.

04:27.267 --> 04:29.852
After it gigantifies,
it turns into a power type?

04:32.397 --> 04:36.609
When it grows big, it only uses
melee attacks that utilize its power.

04:41.572 --> 04:44.617
Then, how about this?

04:58.965 --> 05:00.341
Look out!

05:14.689 --> 05:16.482
It's not just power.

05:16.566 --> 05:18.318
Ain't that unfair?

05:18.401 --> 05:20.445
Are projectiles like that legit?

05:21.237 --> 05:22.947
Space kaiju.

05:41.883 --> 05:44.886
Listen here! You should be
more mindful of time and place!

05:46.763 --> 05:48.306
If you don't...

05:48.890 --> 05:50.975
then you'll never be popular!

05:55.855 --> 05:57.065
Nice one, Aira!

05:57.148 --> 06:00.151
Slowpoke Momo Ayase, you go for the legs!

06:00.234 --> 06:02.987
And you shall call me "Leader"!

06:03.613 --> 06:07.742
Shut up already! Blockhead Aira!

06:15.500 --> 06:17.085
How's that?

06:21.756 --> 06:23.132
You fool!

06:23.216 --> 06:25.635
It's because you didn't call me Leader!

06:26.177 --> 06:28.262
Behold how a leader moves

06:28.888 --> 06:31.182
and watch closely!

06:47.740 --> 06:50.118
How's that, Momo Ayase?

06:50.201 --> 06:52.328
This is how a leader moves!

06:54.163 --> 06:55.039
Behind you!

07:02.255 --> 07:05.383
Leader this, leader that. Shut up already!

07:10.471 --> 07:11.722
Unhand me!

07:14.434 --> 07:16.602
You are not damaging it!

07:16.686 --> 07:19.313
That's fine! More like, help me out here!

07:19.397 --> 07:21.899
Huh? Why would I help you?

07:21.983 --> 07:25.194
Are you saying the leader
can't show me some teamwork?

07:28.531 --> 07:30.116
I suppose I must!

08:15.369 --> 08:16.913
It's running out of control!

08:16.996 --> 08:18.998
Who is it after?

08:31.344 --> 08:34.138
Perhaps that kaiju
is the descendant of a dinosaur,

08:34.222 --> 08:36.557
and it's evolved to survive in space.

08:36.641 --> 08:41.187
Maybe it converts an unknown cosmic energy
into electrical energy with that horn?

08:41.270 --> 08:44.148
That would explain
the optical camouflage, too.

08:44.232 --> 08:47.777
If we can get to the light source,
we might be able to stop it.

08:47.860 --> 08:51.280
In the meantime, I will keep
diverting this thing's attention!

08:59.705 --> 09:01.082
Not bad!

09:02.458 --> 09:04.377
Now, let's do this!

09:07.296 --> 09:08.548
All right!

09:16.722 --> 09:18.683
Eat this!

09:25.731 --> 09:27.358
A job well done.

09:32.196 --> 09:34.949
It's finally my turn to shine.

09:40.079 --> 09:41.414
What's this?

09:41.497 --> 09:44.667
It got scared of a powerful,
pretty soldier and ran away.

09:44.750 --> 09:47.545
You moron, it hasn't run away!
It's coming!

09:47.628 --> 09:50.506
What are you talking about? It's not here!

09:54.051 --> 09:55.428
- Aira!
- Aira-chan!

09:59.974 --> 10:01.851
Aira-chan, jump!

10:06.564 --> 10:08.274
Ouch!

10:08.357 --> 10:09.567
What's going on here?

10:10.443 --> 10:11.777
Don't drop your guard.

10:11.861 --> 10:13.571
It's right there.

10:13.654 --> 10:16.365
You can't see it because it's invisible.

10:16.949 --> 10:19.702
Invisible, you say?

10:24.832 --> 10:27.501
I can only see a dust cloud!

10:33.883 --> 10:35.259
Aira!

10:40.306 --> 10:41.474
Aira-chan!

10:54.445 --> 10:58.240
Let's go!

10:58.324 --> 11:01.869
Damn it! What's up with this?

11:01.952 --> 11:04.580
What's going on here?

11:04.664 --> 11:08.167
P-Please don't drip that sweat on me!

11:08.250 --> 11:11.587
H-How horrible!
This handsome guy is the worst!

11:11.671 --> 11:15.091
He puts up a good front,
but he actually looks down on people!

11:15.174 --> 11:16.550
It's nothing like that!

11:16.634 --> 11:19.887
Damn it, take my sweat and snot!

11:19.970 --> 11:22.098
Wait up! Stop! Seriously!

11:22.181 --> 11:25.393
I'll end up becoming
a complicated po-po-po-pow!

11:29.271 --> 11:31.357
Ouch! You're the worst!

11:31.440 --> 11:33.150
This handsome guy is the worst!

11:49.792 --> 11:51.377
That was close.

11:51.460 --> 11:53.462
No, seriously. Please don't do that.

12:07.351 --> 12:10.771
Who're you? You wanna be murdered?

12:11.564 --> 12:13.566
Your face changed?

12:16.360 --> 12:19.447
Why do you stand before me?

12:23.075 --> 12:27.621
Are you someone like Takakura?

12:32.626 --> 12:34.545
Wait! Where are you going?

12:34.628 --> 12:36.630
You need to take me and flee, don't you?

12:36.714 --> 12:39.842
Are you going to leave me
all alone? Is that okay?

12:39.925 --> 12:43.179
What will Miss Momo Ayase say
if you did something like that?

12:43.262 --> 12:44.138
Huh?

12:44.221 --> 12:45.723
Where is Momo?

12:45.806 --> 12:49.226
What are you talking about?
She told you earlier to flee!

12:49.310 --> 12:51.604
She said regroup at her house!

12:51.687 --> 12:53.022
Regroup?

12:53.981 --> 12:57.610
Is today the day that I can fight him?

12:58.819 --> 13:00.029
Hurray!

13:01.030 --> 13:02.573
Hey, hold on a second!

13:02.656 --> 13:05.034
Don't leave me behind!

13:11.749 --> 13:12.708
Okarun!

13:16.504 --> 13:17.713
Going full throttle.

13:22.092 --> 13:23.469
Nice one, Okarun!

13:23.552 --> 13:24.678
Crap!

13:24.762 --> 13:27.431
I used my second full throttle!

13:27.515 --> 13:28.891
What?

13:30.684 --> 13:33.187
I'm falling!

13:35.564 --> 13:37.900
Miss Ayase, thank you very much!

13:37.983 --> 13:39.944
Don't, "Whoa!" me!

13:40.027 --> 13:42.488
What are we gonna do?
You can't transform anymore!

13:42.571 --> 13:45.157
There's nothing I can do about it! Huh?

13:58.295 --> 14:00.422
Retreat!

14:00.506 --> 14:01.757
Miss Ayase!

14:01.840 --> 14:04.468
The power lines!
We're gonna hit the power lines!

14:04.552 --> 14:05.886
Shut up!

14:05.970 --> 14:07.596
Run by yourself, then!

14:07.680 --> 14:10.683
That's impossible!
Miss Shiratori is unconscious!

14:10.766 --> 14:13.185
Wake her up. She's the leader, isn't she?

14:13.269 --> 14:15.854
But that's so terrible!

14:19.441 --> 14:24.363
Ugh, geez! I'm the only one
who's doing all the running!

14:24.446 --> 14:27.324
I'm so sorry, Miss Ayase.
Thank you very much!

14:27.908 --> 14:31.036
We have our barrier for now,
so our place would be okay, right?

14:31.120 --> 14:34.206
Huh? Miss Shiratori, are you all right?

14:34.290 --> 14:35.749
Huh? She's not peeling off.

14:35.833 --> 14:36.834
Miss Shiratori!

14:38.127 --> 14:40.212
Hey! She's faking it!

14:40.296 --> 14:41.755
Get off, damn you!

14:41.839 --> 14:44.466
So horrible! What the hell are you doing?

14:44.550 --> 14:46.385
Since when were you faking it, you skank?

14:46.468 --> 14:49.513
Give me back the steps
that brought you all the way here!

14:49.597 --> 14:50.598
Like I could return it!

14:50.681 --> 14:54.310
I was hit by an attack because
you're a slowpoke in the first place!

14:54.393 --> 14:56.353
Oh, you're here!

14:57.688 --> 14:59.440
H-He's turned into Evil Eye!

14:59.523 --> 15:00.691
What?

15:01.901 --> 15:05.029
Let's hurry up and fight!
I'm sick of waiting for you!

15:05.112 --> 15:07.448
Today isn't a day to fight, so nope.

15:07.531 --> 15:09.950
That's right, Evil Eye. Today isn't it.

15:10.034 --> 15:11.452
He has clothes on.

15:17.041 --> 15:20.210
What should we do?
Should we ask Evil Eye to fight with us?

15:20.294 --> 15:21.795
We can't do that.

15:21.879 --> 15:24.590
The promise is that
he's only going to fight with me.

15:24.673 --> 15:26.759
If it becomes okay
for him to fight others,

15:26.842 --> 15:30.137
then who knows
what he'll think afterwards.

15:35.559 --> 15:37.645
Is Ms. Seiko not home?

15:37.728 --> 15:40.731
She's in a different prefecture today
for a TV show.

15:40.814 --> 15:44.693
Oh, crap! We can't do this
if it's just me and Aira, huh?

15:44.777 --> 15:47.696
It'd be nice if we knew
about its weakness or something.

15:47.780 --> 15:49.823
Man, this sucks.

15:50.741 --> 15:52.451
Miss Ayase, what's that?

15:53.661 --> 15:55.454
That part is glowing.

15:56.288 --> 15:57.790
May I see it for a bit?

15:57.873 --> 15:59.041
What's up?

16:19.478 --> 16:21.397
It's here!

16:21.480 --> 16:24.108
The kaiju is headed this way!

16:24.191 --> 16:25.693
Momo Ayase! It's coming!

16:25.776 --> 16:27.861
Crap! I guess we gotta do this!

16:35.285 --> 16:38.664
Okarun, take care of Evil Eye
and Perv over here, too!

16:38.747 --> 16:42.793
Eek! This is a terrible dream!
It's not reality!

16:42.876 --> 16:44.128
Who the hell is this guy?

16:52.428 --> 16:54.430
Miss Ayase! Let's use this!

16:54.972 --> 16:56.515
The nanoskin!

16:56.598 --> 16:58.892
We fixed this house with nanoskin!

16:58.976 --> 17:01.020
That's why it was glimmering!

17:01.103 --> 17:03.731
Hold on, this isn't the time for...

17:03.814 --> 17:05.357
If we use this nanoskin,

17:05.441 --> 17:09.069
we might be able
to defeat that space kaiju!

17:25.461 --> 17:29.173
Crap! The footsteps are getting closer!

17:29.256 --> 17:33.385
Okarun, what's your strategy?
How are we gonna use this to defeat it?

17:34.219 --> 17:36.013
Hey, what're you doing?

17:36.096 --> 17:37.681
I wanna murder.

17:37.765 --> 17:41.518
This house is almost
completely made from nanoskin.

17:42.728 --> 17:48.776
Mr. Ludris said that nanoskin is made
from ultra-high-density nanomachines.

17:49.359 --> 17:52.738
The nanomachines
catch our brains' electric signals

17:52.821 --> 17:55.532
and give shape to what we imagine.

17:57.743 --> 17:59.453
So, what does that mean?

17:59.536 --> 18:01.330
I'll just try it out for starters!

18:01.413 --> 18:02.706
I wanna kill.

18:02.790 --> 18:03.957
Don't get in the way!

18:04.041 --> 18:05.334
Did you say nanomachines?

18:07.628 --> 18:08.587
Listen up.

18:08.670 --> 18:12.091
Imagine that this entire house
is one nanoskin,

18:12.674 --> 18:15.219
and we'll reshape the entire thing!

18:18.013 --> 18:19.640
Whoa, what is this?

18:19.723 --> 18:21.975
Is this okay?
The house won't break, right?

18:22.059 --> 18:24.645
Crap! I can't imagine it right!

18:24.728 --> 18:26.563
What're you trying to imagine?

18:26.647 --> 18:28.982
Just something really big.

18:30.275 --> 18:32.069
The walls are closing in!

18:32.152 --> 18:34.863
Miss Shiratori, please get away!
I can't concentrate!

18:34.947 --> 18:37.366
Shiratori! You get your ass over here!

18:38.575 --> 18:40.619
Okarun! Turn everything back for now!

18:40.702 --> 18:42.830
Or else we'll get crushed by the house!

18:42.913 --> 18:44.123
Got it!

18:44.206 --> 18:48.710
Takakura, if it's an image
of something big, leave it to me!

18:48.794 --> 18:49.795
Who the hell are you?

18:49.878 --> 18:52.714
Nanomachines are from sci-fi.

18:52.798 --> 18:55.217
And if we're talking sci-fi, I'm your guy!

18:57.136 --> 18:59.805
I'm Kinta Sakata!

19:04.893 --> 19:07.146
What?

19:07.688 --> 19:09.189
A-Amazing!

19:09.273 --> 19:11.024
We somehow got this?

19:11.108 --> 19:12.401
I wanna murder.

19:12.484 --> 19:17.322
Now, bring it on! My imagination!

19:17.406 --> 19:19.116
Here it is!

19:26.915 --> 19:28.458
Miss Shiratori!

19:28.542 --> 19:29.543
I'll murder--

19:36.633 --> 19:38.719
Okarun!

19:44.308 --> 19:45.475
BATHROOM

19:48.395 --> 19:49.605
No!

19:49.688 --> 19:51.398
Anything but falling down!

19:53.358 --> 19:55.360
Wait, going up?

19:55.444 --> 19:57.946
Damn idiots!

19:58.030 --> 20:01.450
Come on, what is this?

20:01.533 --> 20:05.078
My shoulders are gonna fall out!

20:06.038 --> 20:08.874
I wanna... kill.

20:21.178 --> 20:22.387
Yow!

21:07.474 --> 21:10.394
Why?!

21:10.477 --> 21:12.312
Okay, hold on a sec, what's going on?

21:12.396 --> 21:13.563
Can everyone hear me?

21:13.647 --> 21:14.606
I can hear you!

21:14.690 --> 21:16.316
I hear you.

21:16.400 --> 21:19.778
Sakata, this is amazing that you can
imagine something like this.

21:19.861 --> 21:21.822
This isn't what I imagined!

21:21.905 --> 21:23.865
I'm sorry, it might be my fault.

21:23.949 --> 21:26.743
You said something big,
so I thought of a Buddha.

21:27.995 --> 21:31.665
But it's fine because
I'm currently riding in a robot!

21:31.748 --> 21:34.167
Shut up! Stop shouting!

21:34.251 --> 21:38.463
I'm not mature enough to stay quiet
with a robot in front of me!

21:38.547 --> 21:40.257
I wanna kill.

21:40.757 --> 21:45.846
I hereby dub thee
Great Kinta Bodhisattva, Zeta Version!

21:45.929 --> 21:50.559
I have bestowed upon you a name.
Yes, it was me!

21:50.642 --> 21:53.520
Now let's go, Great Kin--

21:55.314 --> 21:59.109
More like, how do we move this thing?

23:38.416 --> 23:39.543
Is this unit...

23:39.626 --> 23:41.253
I don't care, just hurry up and move it!

23:41.336 --> 23:43.505
- You're amazing, Sakata!
- I wanna kill.

23:43.588 --> 23:46.341
- Takakura, are you in love with anyone?
- Can you ask me that question, too?

23:46.424 --> 23:48.260
-Who's this guy?
- Let's go, everyone!

23:48.343 --> 23:51.138
"Clash! Space Kaiju vs. Giant Robot!"

23:51.221 --> 23:52.931
Please watch it!
